<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HUB International primer — ERP Unite Learning Pack</title>
<style>
:root { --navy: #00395F; --navy-dark: #00253D; --navy-light: #1A5A8A; --cyan: #079FC3; --cyan-light: #4AB9D4; --teal: #00B294; --red: #F1554B; --yellow: #F2B949; --slate: #44546A; --mute: #737373; --bg: #FAFBFC; --border: #E5E9EE; }
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: var(--navy); background: var(--bg); line-height: 1.6; }

.hub-hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-dark) 0%, var(--navy) 50%, var(--navy-light) 100%); color: white; padding: 64px 40px 84px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.hub-hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; right: -10%; width: 600px; height: 600px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(7, 159, 195, 0.22) 0%, transparent 65%); pointer-events: none; }
.hub-hero::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan) 0%, var(--teal) 50%, var(--cyan) 100%); }
.hub-hero-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; }
.breadcrumb { color: var(--cyan-light); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.breadcrumb a { color: var(--cyan-light); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(74, 185, 212, 0.5); padding-bottom: 2px; }
.breadcrumb a:hover { border-color: var(--cyan-light); }
.breadcrumb .sep { opacity: 0.5; margin: 0 8px; }
.module-num { display: inline-block; background: rgba(7, 159, 195, 0.18); border: 1px solid var(--cyan); color: var(--cyan-light); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.hub-hero h1 { font-size: 60px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -1.5px; line-height: 1.04; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.hub-hero h1 strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--cyan-light); }
.hub-hero .tagline { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 880px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
.hub-stats { display: flex; gap: 48px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 12px; }
.hub-stat { border-left: 3px solid var(--cyan); padding-left: 16px; }
.hub-stat-value { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; color: white; line-height: 1; }
.hub-stat-label { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-top: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }

main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 40px 80px; }
.section { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 36px 44px; margin-bottom: 28px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,57,95,0.05); }
.section-eyebrow { color: var(--cyan); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.section h2 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 18px; }
.section p, .section li { font-size: 16.5px; color: #1F2D3D; line-height: 1.72; }
.section p { margin-bottom: 14px; }
.section ul, .section ol { padding-left: 26px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.section ul li, .section ol li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
.section ul ul, .section ol ol { margin-top: 6px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.section strong { color: var(--navy); font-weight: 600; }
.section em { color: var(--slate); }
.section code { background: #F4F7FA; color: var(--navy); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Consolas', monospace; font-size: 0.92em; border: 1px solid #DCE3EB; }
.section a { color: var(--cyan); border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(7, 159, 195, 0.5); text-decoration: none; padding-bottom: 1px; }
.section a:hover { color: var(--navy-dark); border-color: var(--navy-dark); }

.section table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 14px 0 18px 0; font-size: 15px; }
.section table th { background: var(--navy); color: white; text-align: left; padding: 10px 14px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.section table td { padding: 12px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); color: #1F2D3D; vertical-align: top; }
.section table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #F8FAFC; }
.section table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

.callout { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F4FAFD 0%, #FAFCFD 100%); border: 1px solid #C3DCEA; border-left: 4px solid var(--cyan); border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px 28px; margin: 18px 0 6px 0; }
.callout-eyebrow { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: var(--cyan); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.callout p { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; }
.callout ul, .callout ol { padding-left: 22px; }
.callout-flow p { padding-left: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.callout-split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px; }
@media (max-width: 720px) { .callout-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.test-yourself { padding-left: 22px; }
.test-yourself li { margin-bottom: 10px; }

.hub-nav { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: stretch; margin: 48px 0 0 0; }
.hub-nav-btn { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 20px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--navy); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease; min-width: 0; }
.hub-nav-btn:hover:not(.disabled) { border-color: var(--cyan); background: #F0F6FB; transform: translateY(-1px); }
.hub-nav-btn.next { text-align: right; }
.hub-nav-btn.disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: default; }
.hub-nav-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--cyan); }
.hub-nav-btn.disabled .hub-nav-label { color: var(--mute); }
.hub-nav-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.hub-nav-pos { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--slate); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; white-space: nowrap; }
.hub-nav-pos:hover { border-color: var(--cyan); color: var(--cyan); }

.deck-link { margin-top: 28px; display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.deck-link .deck-btn { color: white; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--cyan); border: 1px solid var(--cyan); transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease; }
.deck-link .deck-btn:hover { background: var(--cyan-light); border-color: var(--cyan-light); color: var(--navy-dark); }
.deck-link .deck-btn-secondary { background: transparent; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
.deck-link .deck-btn-secondary:hover { background: white; color: var(--navy); border-color: white; }
.deck-link .deck-meta { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-left: 6px; }

footer { background: var(--navy-dark); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; }
footer a { color: var(--cyan-light); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(74, 185, 212, 0.5); }
footer a:hover { color: white; border-color: white; }

@media (max-width: 720px) { .hub-hero h1 { font-size: 40px; } .hub-hero .tagline { font-size: 17px; } .hub-nav { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } main { padding: 32px 20px; } .section { padding: 24px 22px; } }
/* Landing-specific */
.feat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
.feat-card { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px 26px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-height: 220px; }
.feat-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 57, 95, 0.14); border-color: var(--cyan); }
.feat-card .num { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--cyan); letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.feat-card h3 { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); margin: 4px 0 6px 0; line-height: 1.25; }
.feat-card p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--slate); line-height: 1.55; }
.feat-card .card-stat { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
.feat-card .card-stat-value { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--cyan); }
.feat-card .card-stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--mute); letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
.feat-card .open-cue { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 12px; color: var(--cyan); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
.feat-card-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.feat-card-deck-row { display: flex; margin-top: -1px; background: #F4F7FA; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px; overflow: hidden; }
.feat-card-deck { flex: 1; padding: 10px 18px; color: var(--slate); font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease; text-align: center; }
.feat-card-deck:hover { background: var(--cyan); color: white; }
.feat-card-deck-pptx { flex: 0 0 auto; border-left: 1px solid var(--border); }
.features-eyebrow { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--cyan); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; }
.features-eyebrow .count { color: var(--mute); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hub-hero">
  <div class="hub-hero-inner">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="index.html">← ERP Unite Learning Pack</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      Customer · HUB International
    </div>
    <h1>HUB <strong>International</strong> — customer primer</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Six modules that get an HSO consultant from zero to functional fluency on HUB's business, the retirement-and-wealth industry, and how that shapes the ERP Unite engagement. Source: a Hub International deep-research dossier, refracted through an HSO-implementation lens.</p>
    <div class="hub-stats">
      <div class="hub-stat"><div class="hub-stat-value">6</div><div class="hub-stat-label">modules · ~2 hrs total</div></div>
      <div class="hub-stat"><div class="hub-stat-value">$29B</div><div class="hub-stat-label">customer valuation (May 2025)</div></div>
      <div class="hub-stat"><div class="hub-stat-value">2026–27</div><div class="hub-stat-label">target IPO window</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Why this primer exists</div>
    <h2>HUB International is a non-trivial customer</h2>
    <p>HUB is the largest privately held insurance broker by valuation, the sixth-largest globally by revenue, and one of the two most acquisitive insurance brokers in any given year. The company has bought roughly 600 firms since 1999. The current revenue mix spans Commercial P&amp;C, Employee Benefits, Personal Insurance, and a <strong>$178B Retirement &amp; Private Wealth practice</strong> that doesn't follow insurance-brokerage economics at all.</p>
    <p>This primer is the foundation track of a larger customer pack. It exists for two reasons:</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>So HSO consultants don't show up under-informed.</strong> An HSO consultant who can't explain ERISA §3(38) or what a recordkeeper does cannot have a real conversation with HUB's RPW leadership. This pack closes that gap.</li>
      <li><strong>So HSO scoping calls surface the right risk question.</strong> The biggest open question in any ERP Unite engagement at HUB is whether RPW is in scope. That question only gets answered well by people who understand the practice. This primer is how we get there.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Read the modules in order on a first pass; they build on each other. Each one ends with a five-question "Test yourself" section to confirm the material landed.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="features-eyebrow">
    <span>The six modules</span>
    <span class="count">6 modules</span>
  </div>
  <div class="feat-grid">
    <div class="feat-card-wrap">
