        <p>The practice that doesn't look like insurance brokerage. $178B in advisory assets across institutional plan sponsors and private wealth — built largely through 25-plus acquisitions since 2019.</p>
        <div class="card-stat"><span class="card-stat-value">$178B</span><span class="card-stat-label">advisory AUM (June 2025)</span></div>
        <span class="open-cue">Open module →</span>
