  <div class="section" style="margin-top: 48px;">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Coming next</div>
    <h2>Track B — ERP Unite × HUB implementation brief</h2>
    <p>The follow-on track maps each Unite hub (CashHub, CompHub, IntegrationHub, Producer Portal) through HUB's specific business shape — what statements look like with 600+ acquired entities, where the RPW gap actually lives in the data model, and which carriers and recordkeepers we need day-1 feeds from. Pending commit.</p>
  </div>
</main>

